WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.960
<b>March 8th, 5:20 PM</b>

00:06.210 --> 00:07.210
Done.

00:08.080 --> 00:09.080
Ike.

00:10.580 --> 00:11.880
Break it.

00:18.130 --> 00:18.830
What?

00:19.790 --> 00:21.040
Oh!

00:21.040 --> 00:23.210
Now that's a surprise.

00:23.580 --> 00:26.130
See? That's what he's got in him.

00:26.130 --> 00:28.880
And it was only infused with a bit of silverine.

00:30.210 --> 00:33.330
Will this enhanced state last for long?

00:34.670 --> 00:37.040
As you use a weapon, the silverine
infused in it will decrease...

00:37.830 --> 00:38.830
Ma'am.

00:39.460 --> 00:43.920
Silverine's power will deteriorate
a weapon's durability,

00:43.920 --> 00:46.420
but this sword is of such a high quality,

00:46.420 --> 00:49.960
I don't think you need to worry
about that... Ma'am.

00:49.960 --> 00:51.500
O-of course it is!

00:51.500 --> 00:53.710
After all, it's one of my creations!

00:54.250 --> 00:57.130
Your silverine isn't half bad.

00:57.130 --> 01:01.130
I may even admit it is a
worthy match for my sword.

01:01.130 --> 01:02.250
Okay...

01:02.630 --> 01:06.000
At least she's capable of holding an
actual conversation with him now.

01:06.000 --> 01:07.080
Indeed.

01:07.080 --> 01:12.460
It appears that Her Highness has made up
her mind on how to handle this.

01:12.460 --> 01:15.080
D-do not be mistaken!

01:15.080 --> 01:17.830
I'm only referring to my sword and
your silverine! Nothing more!

01:17.830 --> 01:22.330
I am not at all alluding to any personal
chemistry between you and I!

01:22.330 --> 01:25.040
Huh? Uh, okay.

01:25.290 --> 01:28.040
This feels like a bizarre way to handle it.

01:28.040 --> 01:29.000
Then it's decided!

01:29.380 --> 01:33.330
Bring all our weapons to him!

03:04.000 --> 03:05.920
<b>March 8th, 5:30 PM</b>

03:06.000 --> 03:07.130
Come on!

03:06.460 --> 03:10.920
<b>Episode 11: Tactics and Knowledge</b>

03:07.130 --> 03:08.000
Kill him!

03:08.000 --> 03:08.920
What's the hold up?

03:08.920 --> 03:10.130
Just do it already!

03:17.130 --> 03:18.420
I've infused it.

03:18.420 --> 03:19.670
Here you go.

03:19.670 --> 03:21.080
D-damn it!

03:21.080 --> 03:21.960
Step aside!

03:21.960 --> 03:23.670
It's my turn now!

03:24.960 --> 03:25.710
Next.

03:26.580 --> 03:27.210
Next.

03:27.880 --> 03:28.710
Next.

03:31.750 --> 03:35.420
Is it really a good idea for me
to be doing this?

03:36.040 --> 03:38.500
Keep half of your silverine for your own use,

03:38.500 --> 03:42.130
and use the other half to infuse
the corps' weapons.

03:42.420 --> 03:45.540
You won't be using Silverine Battle Arts
during the upcoming battle.

03:45.540 --> 03:47.710
Nothing good will come of you using it.

03:48.170 --> 03:50.670
Admittedly, I'm not in peak condition now.

03:50.670 --> 03:53.960
But it's not like my body can't move.

03:54.290 --> 03:57.130
It would clearly be best for me
to fight on my own,

03:57.130 --> 03:59.630
so should I really not use
Silverine Battle Arts?

03:59.630 --> 04:00.880
Why?

04:00.880 --> 04:02.130
I just don't get it.

04:02.380 --> 04:03.880
Speaking of things I don't get...

04:03.880 --> 04:04.630
That's it! Get him! Kill him!

04:03.880 --> 04:06.540
<b>Silverware Princess Appreciation Club</b>

04:03.880 --> 04:06.540
<b>President</b>

04:04.630 --> 04:06.540
That's it! Get him! Kill him!
Why do these people keep<b>
</b>attacking me so fervently?<b></b>

04:06.540 --> 04:08.040
Why do these people keep
attacking me so fervently?

04:08.040 --> 04:11.500
Did I do something to upset them?

04:11.500 --> 04:13.960
If I did, I'd like to apologize, but...

04:13.960 --> 04:15.000
Damn it!

04:14.290 --> 04:18.420
<b>Silverware Princess Appreciation Club</b>

04:14.290 --> 04:18.420
<b>Member</b>

04:15.000 --> 04:18.420
I don't get what our commander
sees in this stupid kid at all!

04:19.170 --> 04:21.420
I have no clue what their problem is!

04:21.420 --> 04:23.920
Damn him! He's got some nerve,
looking so unbothered!

04:23.920 --> 04:25.670
I can't stand how this crowd of people
is staring at me.

04:25.670 --> 04:28.920
Wipe that self-assured look off his face!

04:28.920 --> 04:31.210
I can't stop sweating.

04:31.460 --> 04:33.960
I just wanna get this over with
so I can go back to my cell!

04:35.750 --> 04:36.920
Draw.

04:36.920 --> 04:37.920
Shin!

04:37.920 --> 04:39.210
It's Shin!

04:40.000 --> 04:42.130
Chief Swordsman, Shin Cutlass.

04:43.500 --> 04:45.790
I'm not like all those amateurs.

04:49.750 --> 04:51.580
Oh, you are strong.

04:51.580 --> 04:53.500
I didn't even have a chance
to infuse any silverine.

04:55.580 --> 04:57.330
He's on Leo's level.

04:57.330 --> 04:58.710
Maybe even stronger than her.

04:59.830 --> 05:03.330
I-I don't n-need your pity!

05:03.330 --> 05:05.130
Oh, but the silverine, I still-

05:05.380 --> 05:07.290
Damn you, useless pipsqueak!

05:07.290 --> 05:09.250
Okay, next!
Get on with it and get up there!

05:09.420 --> 05:10.960
Don't let him rest!

05:10.960 --> 05:13.040
Get back to work, uggo!

05:16.290 --> 05:18.750
Well, this is just pathetic.

05:18.750 --> 05:21.670
Two chief swordsmen are
blubbering and crying.

05:21.670 --> 05:22.750
I ain't crying!

05:22.750 --> 05:24.080
You're totally crying, man.

05:24.080 --> 05:25.290
Shut up!

05:25.290 --> 05:27.330
Hurry up and get your ass kicked, Chris!

05:27.330 --> 05:32.130
I already lost and got my weapon
infused with silverine.

05:32.130 --> 05:34.830
Then why're you acting so nonchalant?

05:34.830 --> 05:39.580
It's only natural for warriors to want
a powerful weapon, right?

05:39.960 --> 05:43.790
That's the reason I joined the corps
in the first place.

05:43.790 --> 05:47.670
Now, I feel like I'd be able to cut through
a superior dragon like butter.

05:47.670 --> 05:48.540
Tch!

05:48.540 --> 05:50.750
There's a huge difference between

05:50.750 --> 05:54.460
getting strong with a good weapon and
being strong with a strong weapon!

05:54.460 --> 05:56.040
You're being stubborn as
a mule about this.

05:56.040 --> 05:57.670
Well, I get what you're saying though.

05:57.960 --> 06:00.000
He's so powerful at such a young age.

06:00.000 --> 06:03.330
On top of that, he has greater special
abilities than our commander.

06:03.330 --> 06:06.920
He makes you feel the difference that
being born with natural power makes.

06:07.290 --> 06:10.750
If I told you that didn't bother me,
it'd be a lie.

06:10.750 --> 06:13.250
He doesn't have natural power.

06:13.250 --> 06:14.330
Huh?

06:14.330 --> 06:16.040
He's the opposite of naturally gifted.

06:16.040 --> 06:18.750
Although we only fought for a moment,

06:18.750 --> 06:22.330
I could sense that was the crowning
achievement of a talentless man's training.

06:24.460 --> 06:26.830
I felt that weight.

06:26.830 --> 06:30.960
Is that kid older than he looks?

06:30.960 --> 06:33.080
I don't know about that.

06:33.750 --> 06:36.290
But it was unmistakable.

06:36.710 --> 06:43.250
And to be frank, realizing I had been lazy
at this advanced age is painful.

06:43.250 --> 06:46.380
What? Is that why you've been moping?

06:46.380 --> 06:49.460
I was sure it was because
the commander fell for that guy.

06:49.460 --> 06:52.210
That is also exceedingly painful.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.290
Where are ya going, Shin?

06:55.290 --> 06:57.790
I've had enough of you old farts
feeling sorry for yourselves.

06:59.420 --> 07:01.420
I'm gonna challenge him to a fight again!

07:01.880 --> 07:04.170
And if I lose, I'll challenge him
however many times I have to!

07:04.750 --> 07:06.920
I don't wanna be

07:06.920 --> 07:10.290
the extra that stands behind
the powerful hero on the battlefield.

07:10.960 --> 07:12.880
<b>March 8th, 8:35 PM</b>

07:11.880 --> 07:12.880
Hey, hey!

07:13.210 --> 07:15.880
Reaper, what do you think of Miss Lia?

07:16.630 --> 07:18.500
Um...

07:18.500 --> 07:19.420
I'm Greya.

07:19.420 --> 07:20.380
And I'm Hesela.

07:20.380 --> 07:21.380
What's your name, Reaper?

07:21.380 --> 07:22.630
Ragna.

07:22.630 --> 07:23.880
Ohhh.

07:24.500 --> 07:25.460
<b>7th defeat</b>

07:25.630 --> 07:26.420
So?

07:26.420 --> 07:28.250
Whatcha think of Miss Lia?

07:28.250 --> 07:30.040
Wh-what do I think of her?

07:30.040 --> 07:30.830
Do you like her?

07:30.830 --> 07:31.670
Or not?

07:31.670 --> 07:34.170
I d-don't like or dislike her.

07:34.170 --> 07:35.630
I only just met her.

07:35.630 --> 07:38.210
You still can have an opinion on someone
after you've just met.

07:38.210 --> 07:40.460
Like, "She's cute!" or "I hate her already!"

07:40.460 --> 07:42.880
Miss Lia said you're so hot!

07:43.580 --> 07:46.630
Honestly, I don't know
what I think about her.

07:47.170 --> 07:48.250
Oh.

07:48.830 --> 07:50.000
You don't?

07:50.000 --> 07:51.170
Why not?

07:51.170 --> 07:53.170
Tell us why!

07:54.000 --> 07:55.290
But...

07:55.290 --> 07:57.630
My face looks like this right now.

07:57.630 --> 08:00.540
How can she know if I am or not
with bandages wrapped

08:00.540 --> 08:02.250
around my head like this?

08:02.670 --> 08:04.670
I'm sure the Silverware Princess

08:04.670 --> 08:08.960
is just imagining I'm hot
under all these bandages.

08:09.880 --> 08:12.380
But the truth is, I'm not hot.

08:12.380 --> 08:15.460
I bet she'll be disappointed
when I take them off.

08:15.830 --> 08:18.830
That's why I'm kinda worried.

08:21.170 --> 08:22.670
You're a funny guy, Ragna!

08:22.670 --> 08:26.330
You only speak clearly when
you're putting yourself down!

08:26.330 --> 08:27.960
What a weirdo!

08:27.960 --> 08:29.960
I-I am?

08:30.830 --> 08:32.130
Ta-da!

08:32.420 --> 08:34.210
These are our weapons!

08:34.210 --> 08:36.540
We fight with guns!

08:36.540 --> 08:41.000
We're giving you the privilege of
infusing our bullets with silverine.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.290
Um...

08:42.290 --> 08:44.920
That's awesome, right?
Feel grateful while you're infusing them!

08:44.920 --> 08:46.710
Uh, okay.

08:47.210 --> 08:48.670
They're so lively.

08:49.210 --> 08:51.790
I think they're around Leo's age.

08:53.630 --> 08:56.380
What'sh making that nishe shmell?

08:56.380 --> 08:57.580
Purun, purun!

08:57.580 --> 08:58.580
It'sh a dragon!

08:58.580 --> 09:00.790
I shmell a dragon!

09:00.790 --> 09:03.130
Mister Slime, you sure that's a good idea?

09:03.130 --> 09:06.000
Aren't you not allowed to show yourself?

09:06.000 --> 09:08.170
Puru! That'sh right, I'm not!

09:08.170 --> 09:10.250
Aww, it's sooo cute!

09:10.250 --> 09:11.670
It's a gnome!

09:11.670 --> 09:12.330
Puru?

09:12.330 --> 09:15.080
Hello there, Mr. Gnome!
What's your name?

09:15.080 --> 09:19.580
I'm Evil Shlime, Lady Crinonica's
number one shervant!

09:19.580 --> 09:21.460
That's so cool! You're a familiar?

09:21.460 --> 09:23.830
I've never seen a talking familiar before!

09:23.830 --> 09:28.290
Pu! Don't lump me in with the likesh
of lowly familiars, you little hu-

09:28.290 --> 09:29.420
Hm?

09:29.790 --> 09:33.130
Your fashes look shorta dragon-like.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.500
Your eyesh and teeth!

09:35.500 --> 09:37.380
You look pretty dragonish
for shome humansh!

09:37.380 --> 09:39.880
It givesh me the creepsh!

09:39.880 --> 09:42.460
You poor thingsh!
What weird looking, shrimpy humansh!

09:42.460 --> 09:44.920
Huh? Their mood just shifted...

09:45.710 --> 09:47.080
Hey, little Slime.

09:47.080 --> 09:49.170
Wanna eat some yummy snacks?

09:49.170 --> 09:51.080
Shnacksh? Ish it a dragon?

09:51.080 --> 09:52.670
You wanna eat a dragon?

09:52.670 --> 09:54.250
Yesh, I wanna eat a dragon!

09:54.250 --> 09:56.210
I'll get bigger after eating shome!

09:56.210 --> 09:58.630
We'll ask Miss Lia to set aside
some for you.

09:58.630 --> 09:59.630
Pururun!

09:59.630 --> 10:03.040
In that cashe, take me to the shnacksh
at onshe, hideoush humansh!

10:03.330 --> 10:04.580
M'kay!

10:05.130 --> 10:06.880
Let's go!

10:08.790 --> 10:10.540
I wonder why I feel like...

10:10.880 --> 10:16.830
I'll never see him in good health
and spirits again.

10:19.380 --> 10:20.580
Puru?

10:21.130 --> 10:23.080
Where'sh the dragon shnack?

10:23.080 --> 10:25.670
We have no memories of our parents.

10:25.670 --> 10:26.710
Pururu?

10:26.710 --> 10:30.580
Our earliest memories were of
being in a circus freak show,

10:30.580 --> 10:32.580
"The Children Descended from Dragons."

10:32.580 --> 10:37.040
Society treats people like us very harshly.

10:37.250 --> 10:39.460
What exshactly are you talking about?

10:42.460 --> 10:47.000
Because we grew up in such a harsh
environment, we're emotionally stunted.

10:47.460 --> 10:50.380
We especially don't understand humiliation.

10:50.380 --> 10:51.500
Puru...

10:53.580 --> 10:59.790
Now, we try to foster learned emotions
by copying children our age.

11:00.580 --> 11:03.830
Your insults do not actually upset us.

11:04.250 --> 11:07.130
But we're deliberately choosing to be angry.

11:08.960 --> 11:11.830
Relax, we're not gonna kill you.

11:13.420 --> 11:16.880
We'll just do to you what
kids our age do to small animals.

11:16.880 --> 11:19.580
We'll just play a cute prank on you.

11:20.210 --> 11:23.460
First, we'll kick it off with anal sphincter
stretching using firecrackers.

11:24.920 --> 11:26.750
Keep your butthole relaxed.

11:29.290 --> 11:31.420
What is magic power?

11:32.000 --> 11:35.040
It's the power to change the world.

11:35.290 --> 11:39.170
So, if the question is,
"What is magic skill?"

11:39.170 --> 11:44.420
Then the answer is, "The means to direct
the changes created by magic power."

11:45.000 --> 11:48.290
Gather magic power
in your fingertips and recite.

11:48.790 --> 11:51.170
Ryuquy yaha famulah.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.710
And then there is fire.

11:55.040 --> 11:59.420
Those are the magic words that direct
magical change that creates fire.

12:00.210 --> 12:02.630
There are other methods to shape the world.

12:02.920 --> 12:05.880
If one does this...

12:06.170 --> 12:07.170
And this...

12:07.380 --> 12:08.460
And this.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.460
Then there is fire.

12:10.460 --> 12:13.630
If you put your hands together
in that order,

12:13.630 --> 12:16.290
you can also direct the same change.

12:16.750 --> 12:19.500
There are many ways to create
the same change

12:19.500 --> 12:21.380
for those who have mastered them.

12:21.790 --> 12:27.210
Superior dragons are the masters of
the mightiest form of magic.

12:27.630 --> 12:32.830
The blood coursing through their bodies
is a form of magical expression.

12:33.250 --> 12:35.920
By simply envisioning the change
they want to create,

12:35.920 --> 12:38.960
they can conjure potent magic.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.960
That's why they're powerful.

12:42.330 --> 12:47.210
That's why thaumaturgy
imitates the magic of dragons.

12:47.880 --> 12:51.460
Magic circles are modelled after
the flow of dragon's blood.

12:51.830 --> 12:54.670
The center of the circle is the heart.

12:54.670 --> 12:57.540
Magic circulates and cycles
through the veins.

12:58.000 --> 13:00.920
As more and more years are spent
accumulating research,

13:00.920 --> 13:04.080
the more it gains on that of dragon power.

13:04.080 --> 13:06.710
That is the calling of a Thaumaturge.

13:08.210 --> 13:09.420
It's no good.

13:09.670 --> 13:11.210
We're stumped.

13:13.880 --> 13:17.750
We completed the teleportation
and absorption circles,

13:17.750 --> 13:20.290
but they still aren't connecting right!

13:20.290 --> 13:25.080
As it stands, it will take the magical power
of 15.7 inferior dragons

13:25.080 --> 13:27.460
to teleport one single person.

13:27.460 --> 13:29.580
And we have 1,800 people...

13:29.580 --> 13:30.790
Argh!

13:30.790 --> 13:33.040
We could take down
every dragon attacking us,

13:33.040 --> 13:34.630
and it still wouldn't be enough!

13:34.630 --> 13:40.580
I think it's so tricky because we designated
only humans as teleportation targets.

13:40.580 --> 13:43.920
Oh! That's it! Let's get rid of this part!

13:43.920 --> 13:48.130
Dragons will come with us
if we do that, Miss Majo!

13:48.130 --> 13:50.380
Phooey! That'd make running away pointless!

13:50.380 --> 13:51.380
What a laugh!

13:53.460 --> 13:55.080
It's no good at all.

13:55.080 --> 13:59.920
My subordinates brains have turned to mush
from working all night day after day.

14:00.460 --> 14:03.750
We can't get any further with past research.

14:03.750 --> 14:06.960
From here on out, we'll need
creativity and experimentation.

14:07.330 --> 14:09.580
But there's no time for that.

14:09.580 --> 14:12.250
Worst-case scenario,
the dragons get here tomorrow.

14:12.250 --> 14:17.710
Well, at this rate, the commander will
purge me before the dragons even get here.

14:18.040 --> 14:20.750
Would I be better off dipping tonight?

14:20.750 --> 14:23.460
Master Fu, did you say something just now?

14:23.460 --> 14:26.080
Nah, you're just hearing things.

14:26.080 --> 14:28.500
Oh, yes, I'm just hearing things!

14:28.500 --> 14:29.540
Ho, ho, ho!

14:29.540 --> 14:30.880
That's right!

14:33.290 --> 14:35.670
But he's not hearing things, right?

14:35.670 --> 14:38.000
So, you wanna dip, huh?

14:38.000 --> 14:39.880
What are you doing here?

14:40.540 --> 14:42.750
I'm here because you need me.

14:42.750 --> 14:43.750
Huh?

14:44.210 --> 14:46.960
When you reach an impasse,

14:46.960 --> 14:49.960
you need entirely new knowledge
and creativity to overcome it.

14:49.960 --> 14:52.630
That's what you need.

14:53.330 --> 14:55.880
So I came to lend a hand.

15:00.130 --> 15:03.670
"I want to save you from suffering."

15:03.670 --> 15:09.380
When I first heard that, I thought,
"What's this stupid tart going on about?"

15:09.380 --> 15:11.460
But it was exactly as she said.

15:11.960 --> 15:16.380
The fires of hatred burning within me
have been snuffed out.

15:16.830 --> 15:19.460
I have memories from my time as a human.

15:19.460 --> 15:23.500
But I cannot recall the emotions
that should accompany them.

15:23.710 --> 15:27.420
I only feel deep affection for
the Dragon Monarch

15:27.420 --> 15:30.630
who robbed me of what was precious to me.

15:30.830 --> 15:35.830
And more shocking than anything,
I do not even feel ashamed of that.

15:36.250 --> 15:40.540
I thought I might remember something
if I came here.

15:41.290 --> 15:43.420
How about you, Arnold?

15:43.880 --> 15:47.580
Oh, it's Taratectra now, correct?

15:48.670 --> 15:51.380
There is one thing that hasn't changed.

15:51.380 --> 15:52.460
Hm?

15:53.040 --> 15:56.630
We're still warriors.

15:58.380 --> 15:59.790
My comrade in arms.

16:00.080 --> 16:02.790
Here and now, I swear this oath to you.

16:03.790 --> 16:08.630
I swear to never again experience
the humiliation of losing my liege.

16:09.830 --> 16:11.670
Even if she is...

16:12.420 --> 16:18.330
The Dragon Monarch, the one who
stole my human liege from me.

16:18.960 --> 16:24.420
Transforming from a human into a dragon
does not change my purpose

16:24.420 --> 16:26.710
or how I live.

16:28.130 --> 16:29.670
All right, all right!

16:29.670 --> 16:32.670
Now, let's hash out our plan.

16:32.670 --> 16:34.500
There are two things
we need to accomplish.

16:34.500 --> 16:36.630
One: Destroy this country.

16:36.630 --> 16:42.000
Two: Kill the Reaper and his pals
for daring to attack Tia.

16:42.500 --> 16:47.250
You guys don't need to bother yourselves
with the Reaper and his buddies.

16:47.250 --> 16:48.960
They're my prey.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.580
What? Your prey?

16:50.580 --> 16:53.670
You're going to track them down?
Are you really that stupid?

16:53.670 --> 16:55.710
Huh? What'd ya say, bitch?

16:55.710 --> 16:59.880
The enemy obviously decided to attack Tia
when you weren't around.

16:59.880 --> 17:02.380
You want to make the same mistake again?

17:02.380 --> 17:04.540
Do you even comprehend the situation?

17:04.540 --> 17:07.750
Tia lost her Time Control Magic.

17:07.750 --> 17:10.040
If they kill her one time, it's over.

17:10.040 --> 17:12.420
If Tia dies, that's it for us all!

17:12.420 --> 17:13.420
Ha!

17:13.420 --> 17:15.540
You're Tia's bodyguard.

17:15.540 --> 17:17.830
Don't let her out of your sight for a second.

17:17.830 --> 17:19.790
Ha! Shut up, old harpy.

17:19.790 --> 17:22.420
You're trying to give me orders?

17:22.420 --> 17:26.630
Most importantly, our queen asked me
to bring back the enemies' heads.

17:28.040 --> 17:29.750
Is that true, Tia?

17:31.040 --> 17:33.040
I wish I hadn't said that.

17:33.040 --> 17:34.540
You're joking, right?

17:34.540 --> 17:36.330
The more I think about it,

17:36.330 --> 17:40.330
the more I realize I let myself get
too carried away by my emotions earlier.

17:40.330 --> 17:44.670
I cannot help but be persuaded by
the logic in Zora's reasoning.

17:44.670 --> 17:46.790
I was indulging myself.

17:46.790 --> 17:48.920
You sure changed your tune quickly.

17:50.830 --> 17:55.830
What about our heated exchange
in your bed, Flirtymatia?

17:57.750 --> 18:01.290
I wasn't of a sound mind then!

18:01.290 --> 18:02.630
Please forget about that!

18:02.630 --> 18:05.250
Hold up! What heated exchange in bed
are you speaking of?

18:05.250 --> 18:06.790
You wanna know, old witch?

18:06.790 --> 18:07.960
I ain't telling you shit!

18:07.960 --> 18:09.380
It was nothing!

18:09.380 --> 18:10.830
This conversation is over!

18:11.170 --> 18:14.330
I don't think we'll need to look for them.
The enemy will come to us.

18:15.290 --> 18:16.540
What's your rationale?

18:16.540 --> 18:17.960
Nothing.

18:17.960 --> 18:21.000
Only a hunch from the battlefield.

18:21.170 --> 18:23.250
There's no way I'll let you get away!

18:23.250 --> 18:25.500
I'll never let you get away!

18:25.670 --> 18:29.330
I'll make sure every last one of you gets...
I want to kill them as quickly as possible.<b></b>

18:29.330 --> 18:30.670
killed!
hunted!<b></b>

18:31.670 --> 18:35.630
But the enemy also wants to
kill Lady Ultimatia.

18:35.630 --> 18:37.290
I cannot allow that.

18:37.290 --> 18:40.290
I'll be the one who protects Lady Ultimatia!

18:40.500 --> 18:42.130
Nebulim...

18:42.130 --> 18:44.500
Your determination is commendable.

18:45.000 --> 18:49.040
You've grown up into
a real man now, haven't you?

18:49.040 --> 18:51.330
Learn from his example, Kamoron!

18:51.330 --> 18:52.960
Can it, goth hag!

18:52.960 --> 18:54.080
What was that, little punk?

18:54.080 --> 18:56.000
You stupid, idiotic, moronic fool!

18:56.000 --> 18:57.750
I dare you to repeat that, witch queen!
Um, Zora?<b></b>

18:57.750 --> 18:58.710
Hm?

18:58.710 --> 19:02.080
If Kamui and Nebulim stay with me,

19:02.080 --> 19:03.960
then who will destroy the country?

19:03.960 --> 19:09.210
Fulfilling God's desires is more important
to me than my own life.

19:09.210 --> 19:11.500
Leave that to me, Tia!

19:11.500 --> 19:13.330
I'll do a flawless job.

19:14.500 --> 19:18.080
But there is one thing
I want you to understand.

19:18.880 --> 19:22.830
I can no longer be merciful to the humans.

19:24.290 --> 19:29.000
The original plan was to gather as many
humans as possible in the capital,

19:29.000 --> 19:33.500
and have Nebu's barrier erase them
without suffering or fear.

19:33.500 --> 19:35.920
Then once we finished at the capital,

19:35.920 --> 19:37.960
we'd move on to a different city
and do the same there.

19:37.960 --> 19:42.790
That was the plan,
but now we can no longer...

19:43.130 --> 19:44.670
I understand.

19:45.000 --> 19:49.460
I know I can't make selfish demands
like that anymore.

19:49.880 --> 19:52.130
I will not question your methods.

19:52.130 --> 19:58.000
Be quick, meticulous,
and kill every person in this country!

19:58.290 --> 20:00.830
Yes, that will be simple.

20:01.130 --> 20:03.250
Very, very simple.

20:03.670 --> 20:06.080
All you need to do is order the beasts.

20:06.290 --> 20:11.330
Order the 40,000 inferior and medial
dragons in this country and beyond

20:11.330 --> 20:13.210
to devour them.

20:15.250 --> 20:17.580
Of course, we'll take the reins.

20:17.580 --> 20:20.880
Control will be kept at all times through
the intermediary of a medial dragon.

20:20.880 --> 20:24.580
Tara and I will have to deal with
the Silverware Princess.

20:25.290 --> 20:26.380
Borgie!

20:26.380 --> 20:28.210
You'll command them.

20:28.210 --> 20:31.420
You're an old bag of bones,
but you can manage that, right?

20:31.710 --> 20:34.000
Understood. I'll undertake that task.

20:34.000 --> 20:36.130
But you can't kill them and call it a day!

20:36.130 --> 20:38.580
We have to track down the ones
who attacked Tia.

20:38.880 --> 20:43.130
If they're still in the country,
they might have left a trail.

20:43.540 --> 20:45.750
Aren't you forgetting something?

20:46.540 --> 20:51.000
The Reaper might be working with
the Argentum Corps.

20:51.000 --> 20:54.500
If that ends up being the case,
I'll call you.

20:54.500 --> 20:57.460
And I expect you'll make haste
at the speed of lightning.

20:57.460 --> 20:59.790
Ah, what a relief.

21:00.290 --> 21:03.330
Only half of our bloodline's
mature members survived,

21:03.330 --> 21:06.210
but all who remain are dependable.

21:07.080 --> 21:12.250
I think they'll be able to protect and support
the progenitor, today and in the future.

21:15.210 --> 21:16.420
Tara, darling!

21:16.420 --> 21:17.330
Hm?

21:17.330 --> 21:20.210
Join our discussion!

21:20.540 --> 21:22.790
Don't you have something to add?

21:25.080 --> 21:26.920
Do not die.

21:27.540 --> 21:31.170
The mature members of our bloodline
are the progenitor's limbs.

21:31.170 --> 21:33.880
Being useless is out of the question.

21:34.330 --> 21:38.580
And limbs are not supposed to be
easily torn off.

21:39.460 --> 21:42.790
We've already lost half of our limbs.

21:43.880 --> 21:44.960
Our blood.

21:45.750 --> 21:49.330
They've stolen half of our progenitor's limbs.

21:50.000 --> 21:52.540
Fully grasp that humiliation.

21:53.000 --> 21:57.250
Understand that any further loss
is the same as defeat.

22:00.170 --> 22:01.630
Do not die.

22:02.080 --> 22:07.670
Likewise, fulfill your duty.
